WEBVTT

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:46.720
Welcome to Takanashi Productions!

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:51.930
Uh, Ogami-san, good morning.

00:00:51.930 --> 00:00:53.660
My father appreciates your—

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:54.480
No, wait.

00:00:58.430 --> 00:01:00.700
I'm Takanashi Tsumugi, a new employee.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:02.790
I look forward to working with you.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:05.320
I'm office staff member Ogami Banri.

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:08.050
It's very nice to meet you.

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:10.690
So, uh...

00:01:10.690 --> 00:01:11.460
Huh?

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:16.960
Cutting to the chase, Tsumugi-san, you'll 
be working as a manager for an idol group.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:18.710
What?

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:28.150
Gazing at the distant sky...

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:31.690
Someday we'll make it past there

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:37.820
Build a rainbow Next Harmony!

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:44.120
We don't know what's right

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:47.330
So we Try and Jump!

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:50.500
Slamming face first into challenges and laughing

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:54.130
For us It's Only Way!

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:57.300
Make it shake (For Your Sky)

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.920
Make it reach (For Your Heart)

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:03.310
We'll change any and all kinds of pain

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:04.470
Do Live! (Yeah!)

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:05.310
Live! (Yeah!)

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:08.730
In the light!

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:09.810
(One, Two, Three, Four, Five, Six, Seven Go!)

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:15.990
Yes Glory Days! Together we'll run through them

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:18.780
If your voice (Fuu!) reverberates (Dream!)

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:22.280
Then your wishes will become
destiny (Singing New World!)

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:28.790
Give rise now to Age of Stage!

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:35.750
The future surely lies on the other side

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:38.670
Yes... It will keep on evolving

00:02:38.990 --> 00:02:42.050
Our WiSH VOYAGE

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:48.310
Build a rainbow Next Harmony!

00:02:57.730 --> 00:03:00.110
A-An idol group already?

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:03.730
Yes. Our production company 
is making its first attempt

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:05.920
at putting together a male idol group.

00:03:06.390 --> 00:03:08.430
And you want <i>me</i> to manage it?

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:11.900
Yes. The president has 
been planning this project

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:14.610
that will determine the fate 
of the company for years.

00:03:14.610 --> 00:03:17.420
The president said that if this succeeds,

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:20.700
we'll go from eating simple 
lunches to gourmet ones.

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.230
What is Dad—

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:24.700
What is the president thinking?

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:32.520
Now let's have you meet 
the courses of your lunch.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:35.670
The courses of my lunch?

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:49.620
Yes!

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:57.250
Why are they playing basketball?

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.640
Actually, it's three-on-three.

00:03:59.640 --> 00:04:02.200
Yamato-kun, who's winning?

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:03.320
Huh?

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:08.140
Uh, red team's two baskets up on white team.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.560
Traveling.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:16.420
No way, I wasn't walking!

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:18.200
Yellow card.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:19.900
Talk back again and you're out.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.070
What? Damn it.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:23.370
Calm down, Nii-san.

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:24.740
Let's regroup.

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:29.490
Oh, good.

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.610
With him out, we'd be screwed—

00:04:31.610 --> 00:04:32.060
Riku.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:32.590
Huh?

00:04:32.590 --> 00:04:33.380
Whoa!

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:39.240
Sorry.

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:40.280
It's okay. Here.

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:43.380
Thank you.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:46.010
G-Good luck!

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:48.640
Hurry up!

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:48.640
Thanks!

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:54.330
Don't you want to cheer them on?

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:55.910
Nii-san!

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:57.200
All right!

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:57.870
Take this!

00:04:58.640 --> 00:04:59.830
Ack, sorry!

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:02.420
Riku! Back!

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:11.010
Go!

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.520
Yes!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.080
Game over.

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:21.110
With a score of 12 to 12, it's a tie.

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:22.270
Wonderful!

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:24.230
We tied it up!

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.970
You made that last shot.

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:30.280
Thanks to you guys.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:32.040
I thought we could win.

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:36.500
<b>King Pudding</b>

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:33.110
Damn it.

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:35.020
Ref, another round.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.500
Another round!

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:37.720
What?

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:39.280
Good work, boys!

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:41.920
Gather round.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.400
We'll settle this next time.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:48.150
Oh, did you just jinx yourself?

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:49.910
It's so hot.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.370
I want to take a shower.

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.630
Riku-kun, are you okay?

00:05:57.930 --> 00:05:58.900
I'm fine.

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:05.630
Let me introduce you to your manager.

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:06.610
What?

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:08.430
It's her.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:12.350
Um, I was really moved by your match!

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:14.950
You were so serious and hardworking.

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:16.640
I couldn't take my eyes off any of you—

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.550
I couldn't take my eyes off you, either.

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:20.090
Huh?

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:22.040
My beautiful mademoiselle.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:32.700
A kiss to the fingertips 
is no simple greeting.

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:34.750
It's the prologue of lo—

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:36.030
Stop!

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:37.510
You're upsetting her.

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:40.690
Oh, Mitsuki. You mustn't 
get in the way of love.

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:42.400
Love?

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:44.920
Is everyone from your country like this?

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.260
Yes, what about it?

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:52.530
Mademoiselle, will you tell me your name?

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:55.470
It's Takanashi Tsumugi.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:57.750
As a new employee,
even if I still have a lot to learn,

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:58.960
I'm glad to be working with you.

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:01.350
And here we have...

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.480
I'm Izumi Iori.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.880
I'm Nikaido Yamato.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:07.880
Izumi Mitsuki.

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.360
Yotsuba Tamaki.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:12.610
I'm Osaka Sogo.

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:15.840
Hello. I'm Rokuya Nagi.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:18.590
I'm Nanase Riku.

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:20.800
Our manager, huh?

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:23.090
Can such a young girl handle it?

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:25.970
She did say she was new.

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:29.340
And since her name's Takanashi, 
could she be the president's...

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:30.840
It doesn't matter.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:31.970
Hi.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:34.100
She seems to have it together.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:36.660
I look forward to working with you, Manager.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:38.620
Thank you.

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:41.280
Let's work hard together, Manager.

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:42.250
We will.

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:45.210
Manager, thanks for your support earlier.

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:46.130
You're welcome.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:49.540
Hey, Manager. I'm hungry.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:49.880
Huh?

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:51.030
Of course!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:51.590
Huh?

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:55.150
Come on. Your manager isn't your mom.

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:57.440
We just had lunch.

00:07:57.440 --> 00:07:59.540
Those seaweed lunches were small.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.460
I want fried chicken next time.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.790
I'd like hamburg steak!

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:05.850
Sure, once you debut.

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:08.480
We'll be having seaweed until then?

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:10.070
Seriously?

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.810
You all seem close.

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.890
Did you know each other before?

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:20.330
No. Most of us are meeting 
for the first time.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:24.000
What? But you're so in sync.

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:28.930
Excuse me.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:30.610
Sir.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:35.730
Congratulations on your first 
day at work, Tsumugi-kun.

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:39.310
Hey, Kinako. Behave.

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:40.790
Now, then.

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:44.600
What did you think of the 
seven boys Daddy found?

00:08:44.600 --> 00:08:47.640
You're the president, not Daddy.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:51.490
Sorry, sorry. So, how were they?

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:53.070
They were wonderful.

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:56.990
I'm sure they'll become 
idols beloved by everyone.

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:59.250
I see. That's great.

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:02.950
In that case, could you hold an 
audition and cut four of them?

00:09:02.950 --> 00:09:04.920
Yes, four of—

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:06.080
Cut them?!

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:07.380
Yeah.

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:08.500
Why?!

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:11.030
They're not debuting as seven?

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:14.890
I thought about it, and seven's too many.

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:19.470
You'd never be able to remember 
their names, and it's expensive.

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:23.390
The popular group TRIGGER 
has three members.

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:24.330
But...

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:26.540
<i>Sir, it's time.</i>

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.920
Coming.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:32.560
Besides, the Three Musketeers are 
cooler than the Seven Dwarves.

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:34.600
Bye, Kinako.

00:09:37.330 --> 00:09:39.390
W-Wait, please!

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:45.400
Pick the three who will make the most money.

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:48.110
But...

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:49.900
What are you talking about?

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:52.550
We're not debuting as seven?

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:55.770
I'm sorry. There was 
a sudden change of plans.

00:09:55.770 --> 00:09:56.960
I'm sorry.

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:58.970
No...

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:02.850
There's no point in blaming our manager.

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.360
We understand.

00:10:04.360 --> 00:10:06.030
We'll prepare for the audition.

00:10:06.860 --> 00:10:11.620
Oh. Yesterday's ally is today's enemy.

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:15.560
So four of you guys are leaving today.

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:18.010
Why are you assuming you'll pass?

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.470
Because I want to.

00:10:20.440 --> 00:10:22.540
I have to...

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:24.390
I have to stand onstage.

00:10:24.740 --> 00:10:26.940
I'm really sorry.

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:30.030
Nothing to be done about it.

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:34.940
However, don't forget that
 you've broken our trust.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:37.090
You don't need to be so cold.

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:39.220
She couldn't help it.

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:40.000
Right, Manager?

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.400
Couldn't help it?

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:43.750
This is a business.

00:10:44.210 --> 00:10:46.150
She's our business partner.

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:50.000
If we can't trust her to watch 
our backs while we're onstage,

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.460
we can't trust her with our careers.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.260
Business?

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:55.140
Iori, you're a high school student.

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:57.150
You don't need to try so 
hard to act like an adult.

00:10:57.580 --> 00:10:59.450
You're like a child.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:00.080
Huh?

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:03.960
Are you happy as long as you can hold hands 
with your friends, have nap time after recess,

00:11:03.960 --> 00:11:06.570
and earn the approval of your teachers?

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:10.150
You brat, that's no way 
to speak to your elders!

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:11.730
Did you just call me a brat?

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:13.910
Enough already, Iori!

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:16.380
Sorry. He has a sharp tongue.

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:18.610
Hey, Riku-kun, calm down.

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:27.110
Excuse me—

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:27.560
Roger that.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:29.220
I'm out.

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:30.480
Y-Yamato-san?

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:34.400
I'm not willing to push anyone else out.

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:38.990
I was only doing this for revenge.

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:42.220
I'll let the guys with real 
dreams take my place.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.220
Revenge?

00:11:44.220 --> 00:11:45.710
Well, see ya.

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:47.100
Wait!

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:51.080
Please, at least participate 
in the audition!

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:56.680
Maybe I'm being selfish, 
but I want to see more.

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:59.990
I want to see you all sing and dance.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:01.570
Please.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:03.490
Please!

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:11.660
Oh. I can't allow a lady 
to bow her head alone.

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:16.180
I ask that you do this as well.

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:18.610
Please.

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:19.170
Please!

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:23.290
You guys are idiots.

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.900
It'd be one less person to compete with.

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:30.430
That might be true, but I don't 
wanna see you go out like this.

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:35.450
Fine, fine.

00:12:35.450 --> 00:12:37.330
I'll do the audition.

00:12:41.980 --> 00:12:43.530
Thank you.

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:53.110
The Takanashi Production 
Idol Audition will now begin.

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:08.300
When are we getting the results?

00:13:12.900 --> 00:13:13.960
Riku-kun.

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:16.690
Are you okay?

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:18.900
Should I get you something to drink?

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:20.380
Oh, no.

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:22.740
I'll figure it out, then.

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:24.820
What do you guys want?

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:26.390
You're going shopping?

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:27.500
I'll go with you.

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:29.920
Sports drinks if they've got 'em.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:30.850
Same.

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:33.040
Mineral water, please.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.270
King Pudding.

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:37.270
We said "drinks," didn't we?

00:13:40.050 --> 00:13:41.670
Is this everything?

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:45.190
You don't seem to like competition.

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:46.730
What?

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:48.230
I'll pay.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:50.820
Thank you.

00:13:50.820 --> 00:13:52.950
I don't like it, either.

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:55.560
Is that why you offered to drop out?

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:59.620
Something like that.

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:06.440
I'd rather drop out than have them fail.

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:08.270
Yamato-san?

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:11.310
They seem like good guys.

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:14.410
Nii-san?

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:15.890
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:18.980
Me, too.

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:20.540
Want to come with me?

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:23.670
Nah. Since they're taking so long, 
I'm going to ask for the results.

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:25.980
You idiot. Just wait here!

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:28.490
But I'm curious. I'm getting impatient.

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:31.510
Yeah, but you wouldn't want to rush them.

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:32.400
What?

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:34.070
Just sit.

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:35.150
Okay.

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:38.330
Mikki, you're not curious?

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:39.180
Mi...

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.690
Of course I am.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:44.110
But...

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:46.860
I'm used to it.

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:49.210
To auditioning?

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:51.400
That's amazing. It's cool.

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:52.800
You idiot.

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:59.270
If I'm used to it, it just means 
I've failed that many times.

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:00.790
Oh, right.

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:01.890
Nii-san—

00:15:18.750 --> 00:15:20.060
Please, God...

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:23.490
Are you okay?

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.830
What do you mean?

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:27.320
If you want someone to talk 
to, go somewhere else.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:30.490
It's not that. You were scowling.

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:36.200
You and your brother both 
want the same thing.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:37.310
What's wrong with that?!

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:38.860
Nothing!

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:41.830
The only thing that's wrong 
is the way you talk.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.010
You're so unsociable.

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:45.710
I'm sorry.

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:48.290
I just thought it was nice.

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:49.910
You guys seem close.

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:54.650
I bet it'd be fun to work with your brother.

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:58.680
I was just a little jealous.

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:01.600
We're back.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:03.290
Welcome back!

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:05.350
Yamato-san paid for everything.

00:16:05.350 --> 00:16:07.710
You didn't need to tell them.

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:09.910
Thank you.

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:11.610
All right!

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:13.820
The mineral water's for...

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:15.910
Thanks. That's mine.

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:17.730
Keep your face away from me!

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:20.370
You're so beautiful, you'll 
make my heart stop.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.260
What?

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:23.160
I know what you mean.

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.380
Nagi-kun, you really are beautiful.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.820
I've never seen anyone like 
you on TV or in the movies.

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:31.990
You're very interesting, aren't you?

00:16:31.990 --> 00:16:34.080
Uh, you mean our faces?

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:39.310
I'm sure our faces look funny 
to someone as handsome as you.

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:40.840
No, no.

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:44.110
Everyone here is very beautiful.

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:45.880
That's not much coming from you.

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:48.880
You're back.

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:53.300
Here.

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:55.760
Thanks.

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:02.380
You're truly interesting.

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:03.570
What? Our faces?

00:17:03.570 --> 00:17:06.470
No, not that!

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:14.090
What's going to happen?

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:17.980
Depending on the results,
we'll either be in Heaven or Hell.

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:22.110
Whatever happens, let's smile 
and go for ramen after this.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:24.470
What the heck?

00:17:24.470 --> 00:17:26.590
I want pork broth.

00:17:26.590 --> 00:17:28.680
I want fish broth.

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:30.870
I'm surprised you know about that.

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:32.950
We can hop around.

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:33.630
But the calories...

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:36.530
Just do enough exercise to make up for it.

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:39.980
Someday...

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:44.190
Someday I hope all our dreams come true.

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:05.630
You've decided?

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:07.310
Yes, I've decided.

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:09.810
It's no wonder she's your daughter.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:11.730
She decides quickly.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:15.660
Could you show me the applications 
of the boys who passed?

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:16.750
Here.

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:19.850
Let's see...

00:18:19.850 --> 00:18:24.190
Yotsuba Tamaki, Osaka Sogo, Izumi Iori,

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:30.320
Nikaido Yamato, Izumi Mitsuki, 
Rokuya Nagi, Nanase Riku...

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:31.880
What is the meaning of this?

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:35.330
All seven of them have appeal.

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:37.910
Each has a unique charm unlike the others.

00:18:37.910 --> 00:18:39.450
I know that.

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:42.090
That's why I asked you to select—

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:43.490
Yotsuba Tamaki-san.

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:46.820
His singing and dancing are 
on a professional level.

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:49.480
His brazenness is alluring.

00:18:49.990 --> 00:18:51.350
Osaka Sogo-san.

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:53.430
He's stable.

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:56.670
He's essential as an immediate 
asset to the group.

00:18:56.670 --> 00:18:57.860
Izumi Iori-san.

00:18:58.440 --> 00:19:00.170
He's good at singing and dancing.

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:01.810
Above everything, he's in high school.

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:03.670
He has a lot of potential.

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.450
Nikaido Yamato-san.

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:08.940
His excellent expressiveness draws you in.

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:10.790
You can't take your eyes off him.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:12.420
Izumi Mitsuki-san.

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:18.860
He's not particularly good at singing or 
dancing, but he tries exceptionally hard.

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:20.100
It's encouraging.

00:19:20.410 --> 00:19:21.480
Rokuya Nagi-san.

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:24.200
He's kind, elegant, and classy.

00:19:24.200 --> 00:19:26.980
He's a girl's ideal man.

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:29.410
Finally, Nanase Riku-san.

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.340
His singing abilities exceed all the others.

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:35.590
It's a wonder he hasn't debuted yet.

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:41.270
When all seven are together, each one 
of them becomes even more appealing.

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:43.530
The moment I first saw them...

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:50.090
I felt it.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.550
Let the seven of them perform together.

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:54.210
I promise I'll make them a success!

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:57.480
It'll be hard taking care of seven.

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.100
I'll do my absolute best.

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:00.440
You promise?

00:20:00.440 --> 00:20:02.800
I promise! Besides...

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:07.530
The Seven Samurai are cooler 
than the Three Little Pigs.

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:14.470
Uh...

00:20:15.490 --> 00:20:20.240
If you'd chosen three, it would've meant 
they were only that good as idols.

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:22.420
That you were only that good a manager.

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:26.340
I'm glad I was right.

00:20:26.340 --> 00:20:29.670
So, you'd intended to go with 
seven from the start?

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:32.670
You're so mean, Daddy! You tricked me?

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:38.740
But it made you think about 
their charm, didn't it?

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:40.510
Yes, but...

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:47.620
A manager must know what makes 
the idols they manage appealing.

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:48.610
Am I wrong?

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:52.600
I'm glad to have such a great daughter.

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:55.600
Your mother in Heaven must be glad, too.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:57.020
Daddy...

00:20:57.280 --> 00:21:00.680
We're having red rice today.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:04.490
We need to celebrate the 
formation of a new idol group.

00:21:04.940 --> 00:21:05.950
Yes!

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:07.450
We pass?

00:21:07.720 --> 00:21:09.000
All of us?

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:09.850
Yes!

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:11.180
Seriously?

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:12.370
Yes!

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:14.720
Fantastic! Amazing!

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:13.640
All right!

00:21:15.760 --> 00:21:17.730
It'll be great working together, members!

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:19.540
Members?

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:21.700
Thank you, Manager.

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:23.610
You did this for us, didn't you?

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:27.220
No. It was because you all were so charming.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:28.370
Manager.

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:31.290
I've changed my mind about you.

00:21:31.290 --> 00:21:32.830
I take back what I said.

00:21:33.100 --> 00:21:33.980
Huh?

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:36.130
You're slow, aren't you?

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:37.740
Do I have to say it?

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:40.240
I mean you've regained our trust.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:40.980
Some of it, anyway.

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:44.300
Thank you. Thank you so much!

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:51.510
I'll do my best from now on as your manager.

00:21:51.510 --> 00:21:53.240
Thank you for having me.

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:56.290
No, thank you.

00:21:57.190 --> 00:21:58.730
Manager.

00:21:58.730 --> 00:21:59.790
Yeah!

00:22:00.310 --> 00:22:01.940
Oh, and...

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:16.080
<i>That night, we stayed up all night 
coming up with a group name.</i>

00:22:17.410 --> 00:22:19.200
<i>IDOLiSH7.</i>

00:22:18.630 --> 00:22:24.940
<b>Yay</b>

00:22:18.630 --> 00:22:24.940
This is it!

00:22:18.630 --> 00:22:24.940
<b>Definitely!</b>

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:24.940
<i>Before long, they would come to 
shake the entire country of Japan.</i>
